[ti:Money-Drags Us]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Classical & Raga]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]हर बार की कहानी में..
[00:11.67]क्या नया है जो सुनाए..
[00:15.34]प्यार बहुत होता है..
[00:19.01]जब तक पैसा बीच ना आए..
[00:22.69]Same story every time..
[00:26.36]What's new left to say?
[00:30.03]Love is easy, love is full..
[00:33.70]Till money finds its way.
[00:37.37]ना मैं सही ना तू गलत..
[00:41.04]सबको सिर्फ समय चलाए..
[00:44.71]I'm not right, you're not wrong..
[00:48.38]Time just drags us all along.
[00:52.06]क्या सच है क्या झूठ है..
[00:55.73]What is truth? What is a lie?
[00:59.40]Everyone decides what keeps them alive.
[01:03.07]जाने टूटे दिलों के टुकड़े..
[01:06.74]किसी और के आने से फिर जुड़ जाए..
[01:10.41]Broken hearts don't stay that way..
[01:14.08]Someone new walks in one day.
[01:17.75]Male: फिर धड़के दिल के तार..
[01:21.43]Female: The strings inside just start to play..
[01:25.10]Both: And love happens anyway.. फिर से प्यार यूं ही हो जाए..
[01:28.77]Male: लगा रह दिल किनारे से..
[01:32.44]Female: Heart stays anchored to the shore..
[01:36.11]Male: जाने कब तेरे नाम की लहर कब आ जाए..
[01:39.78]Female: Waiting for your name.. a wave I've never seen before..
[01:43.45]Male: मत हो उदास ए दिल..
[01:47.13]ये खास नहीं है बात..
[01:50.80]Female: Don't be sad, heart..
[01:54.47]This isn't special. This isn't new.
[01:58.14]Male: आएगा फिर सैलाब हार्मोन्स का..
[02:01.81]Female: The flood will come again.. chemicals, waves, something true..
[02:05.48]Both unison: तू रख पिया मिलन की आस..
[02:09.15]Female echo: keep the hope, keep the meeting, keep the you..
[02:12.82]Male: तू भी टूटा है..
[02:16.50]Female: Yes.
[02:20.17]Female: तू भी रोया है..
[02:23.84]Male: Yes.
[02:27.51]Male: फिर क्यों अकेले..
[02:31.18]Female: [echo] फिर क्यों अकेले..
[02:34.85]Both unison: बाँट लें दर्द..
[02:38.52]Cycle 1 – both unison, soft: आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ
[02:42.19]Cycle 2 – female only, high: आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ
[02:45.87]Cycle 3 – male only, chest: आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ
[02:49.54]Cycle 4 – both unison, slowing: आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ (last आ held 4 seconds)
[02:53.21]आएगा..
